Package: erw
Type: Package
Title: The Energy Research Warehouse (ERW) in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("ERW", "research project", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = "github.com/SamuelEnrique/erw")
Description: Reads the tables of the Energy Research Warehouse (ERW): US power prices, demand, generation, fuel and
    project tables, each row traceable to the report it came from. The six calls of the ERW packages
    (erw_tables, erw_coverage, erw_fetch, erw_cite, erw_license, erw_standard) over three backends: the
    Stanford Redivis dataset, the live set and local files. Base R only.
License: file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/SamuelEnrique/erw
BugReports: https://github.com/SamuelEnrique/erw/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
